  "properties": {
    "long_instructions": "# Wrap Up\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; background: #f7f8fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto;\">\r\n\r\n  <div>\r\n    <h4 style=\"margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\">In this professional learning module, you learned to:</h4>\r\n    <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 10px; font-size: 14pt\">\r\n      <li>Define artificial intelligence and explain its fundamental concepts.\r\n</li><br>\r\n\t  <li>Explain what Large Language Models are and how they work.\r\n</li><br>\r\n      <li>Identify common misconceptions about AI use and connect them to underlying concepts of how AI works.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div>\r\n    <img src=\"https://images.code.org/89644a0804bcdfc2839b17f70bcef23c-Screenshot 2025-12-04 at 2.33.30 PM.png\" \r\n         alt=\"Icon with computer and weblayout\" \r\n         style=\"border-radius: 10px; width: 200px; height: auto;\">\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n## Closing Reflection\r\n\r\n> #### In the reflection box below, answer **one or more** of the following questions:\r\n> #### &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp 1. How would you define artificial intelligence now, in your own words?\r\n> #### &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp 2. What's one thing you learned about how LLMs work that changed or clarified your understanding. \r\n> #### &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp 3. If a colleague said, “AI just thinks like a human,” how would you respond using what you learned in this module?\r\n",
